<mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>931</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> is speed of the light]"
